0045:     If a source column hits an obstacle segment, paint a horizontal run on the
0046:     row just above the obstacle from the source column to the nearest outside
0047:     side of that segment, then continue vertically downward in that outside
0048:     column.  Exact midpoint ties detour to the right side.
0049: 
0050:     Key insight
