0017:       grid edge and rests immediately above the first solid floor row.
0018: 
0019:     Rule:
0020:     - Clear the source object to the upper background color.
0021:     - Repaint each object row on the opposite side: the first three relative
0022:       rows keep the edge alignment, and each lower row shifts one more pixel
0023:       inward from that side.
0024:     - On the first floor row, repaint the traversed side-to-object segment
0025:       maroon, stopping just before the final outer bottom support pixel.
0026: 
0027:     Key insight:
0028:     - The side of the source object gives the horizontal direction, while the
0029:       row index inside the object gives the one-cell-per-row diagonal shear.
