0021:       pixels of the other foreground color inside the frame.
0022:     Rule
0023:     - Use the frame bbox and marker bbox.
0024:     - Recolor background cells strictly inside the frame to the frame color unless
0025:       they lie inside the marker bbox; keep frame and marker cells unchanged.
0026:     Key insight
0027:     - The marker pixels define a protected rectangular window, not paths to draw.
0028:     """
